":"11b25a8ba8","src":"radio/heksa/hs05.m4a","text":"The post office says parcels arrive lighter. The post office should look closer to home. Num num num.","dur":12.98,"unlock":7,"until":12},{"id":"hs06","h":"dd323f326f","src":"radio/heksa/hs06.m4a","text":"Rumour: a trapdoor. I say, do not believe rumours. I also say, do not come downstairs.","dur":13.55,"unlock":8,"until":12},{"id":"hs07","h":"74eaa9604f","src":"radio/heksa/hs07.m4a","text":"Real weather report: stay inside. Forecast: me. Chance of cookies: high.","dur":12.35,"unlock":10,"until":12},{"id":"hs08","h":"f54ca22454","src":"radio/heksa/hs08.m4a","text":"This station is operated by a machine. The operator is currently unavailable. She is full.","dur":12.35,"unlock":13,"until":null},{"id":"hs09","h":"c5993b564e","src":"radio/heksa/hs09.m4a","text":"Lights. So many lights. Turn them off. Turn them off. This is a recording.","dur":14.45,"unlock":14,"until":null},{"id":"hs10","h":"6f5a2e3a83","src":"radio/heksa/hs10.m4a","text":"The real news about the hill. The hill is looking at you. Wave. It likes it.","dur":12.47,"unlock":17,"until":null},{"id":"hs11","h":"9613038c4c","src":"radio/heksa/hs11.m4a","text":"And now the real, real news. The sky is red. I told you. Nobody listens to the radio witch.","dur":14.54,"unlock":21,"until":null},{"id":"hs12","h":"577240e664","src":"radio/heksa/hs12.m4a","text":"Something under the mountain is snoring. And for once, it is not me.","dur":8.81,"unlock":23,"until":null},{"id":"hs_nj3","h":"124cabc3c3","src":"radio/heksa/hs_nj3.m4a","text":"The real news. They say a ninja course has come. I say it is a trap for cookies. Num.","dur":13.82,"unlock":3,"until":12},{"id":"hs_nj13","h":"f85919c20a","src":"radio/heksa/hs_nj13.m4a","text":"Real news again. The beams in the sky keep me awake. Also the beams make my cat sneeze. I want to see who is paying for the electricity. Num num.","dur":19.85,"unlock":13,"until":null},{"id":"hs13","h":"82c671d46d","src":"radio/heksa/hs13.m4a","text":"This is a recording. The tape keeps saying a name. It is not mine.","dur":10.25,"unlock":19,"until":null}]}